WEBVTT


00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.980
I'm Naomi Watts and we're at the Mugler show in Paris

00:00:03.981 --> 00:00:05.580
What was your first ever job?

00:00:05.581 --> 00:00:11.920
Probably a paper run, but then I scooped ice cream and made milkshakes

00:00:12.480 --> 00:00:13.600
Waited tables,

00:00:14.980 --> 00:00:19.680
spliced film, rolling films manually and cutting and splicing

00:00:19.740 --> 00:00:22.548
I’ve had countless jobs, and then fashion, even

00:00:22.549 --> 00:00:27.131
a fashion assistant, assistant fashion editor for a magazine in Australia

00:00:27.132 --> 00:00:28.131
Anyway, I'm going on,

00:00:28.132 --> 00:00:29.811
I'm going on too long now

00:00:29.812 --> 00:00:34.911
They say the average amount of a career changes is three or more
